          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "[答案]:A [解析]:【解析】方法 1:  $ \\ln(2+x)=\\ln2\\left(1+\\frac{1}{2}x\\right)=\\ln2+\\ln\\left(1+\\frac{1}{2}x\\right)=\\ln2+\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}(-1)^{n-1}\\frac{\\left(\\frac{1}{2}x\\right)^n}{n} $",
          "block_bbox": [
